    "detailed_description": "ENTER HELL, WYOMING, 2003. An athletic, unemployed lunatic is losing money, fast. It's your job to destroy property, kill companies and other odd-jobs to earn cash in this fast-paced crude first person shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450080/extras/eb74095fb24c39fe6e8d28f56f71bfc5.avif?t=1749944301\" /></span><br><strong>Meet Scrume C. Guai. He's an athletic yet pathetic man with a few dollars to his name.</strong> With his extreme muscle mass, Scroomguy can punch at enemies while using the powerful weapons in his roster. His sweet guns include the pistol, a compact machine gun, the shotgun, a high precision revolver, and many more to discover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450080/extras/246b581b3723255733c9020f1ee0ac53.avif?t=1749944301\" /></span><br><strong>Using the state of the art 'computer' and electronic mail, you can discover and perform lethal jobs against the big corporate overlords of Hell, Wyoming.</strong> Destroy property, kill hostile workers, and cause as much destruction as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450080/extras/732af4e35e1d2d700324f2036987c548.avif?t=1749944301\" /></span><br><strong>Perform extra side-tasks in missions and perform high class combos to collect as much money as possible.</strong> Scroomguy's wealth goal? Paying off a full month's worth of rent.",
    "about_the_game": "ENTER HELL, WYOMING, 2003. An athletic, unemployed lunatic is losing money, fast. It's your job to destroy property, kill companies and other odd-jobs to earn cash in this fast-paced crude first person shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450080/extras/eb74095fb24c39fe6e8d28f56f71bfc5.avif?t=1749944301\" /></span><br><strong>Meet Scrume C. Guai. He's an athletic yet pathetic man with a few dollars to his name.</strong> With his extreme muscle mass, Scroomguy can punch at enemies while using the powerful weapons in his roster. His sweet guns include the pistol, a compact machine gun, the shotgun, a high precision revolver, and many more to discover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450080/extras/246b581b3723255733c9020f1ee0ac53.avif?t=1749944301\" /></span><br><strong>Using the state of the art 'computer' and electronic mail, you can discover and perform lethal jobs against the big corporate overlords of Hell, Wyoming.</strong> Destroy property, kill hostile workers, and cause as much destruction as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450080/extras/732af4e35e1d2d700324f2036987c548.avif?t=1749944301\" /></span><br><strong>Perform extra side-tasks in missions and perform high class combos to collect as much money as possible.</strong> Scroomguy's wealth goal? Paying off a full month's worth of rent.",
